  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>Ad Astra</h1>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1073717942014972034/RLib_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Lib\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1073717981118480535/RConfig_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Config\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1090775450437046392/Requires_Botarium_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Botarium\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1073718144910233691/Terrarium_vector.svg\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 製作\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252foptifine_alternatives%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1090845180745240576/optifine_vector.svg\" alt=\"不相容於 Optifine\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>📖關於📖</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><p>Ad Astra！（譯文：「飛向星辰！」）是一款專注於科技、旅行與探索的 Fabric 和 Forge 太空模組。我們提供了你成為太空人所需要的一切：火箭、太空服、太空站和機器。何不在月球上漫步？在火星上建立自給自足的地堡？去金星挖礦？整個太陽系——甚至整個銀河系——都任你探索！</p><ul>\n<li>五個天體：月球、火星、金星、水星和冰川星，分別位於兩個不同的太陽系。每個星球都有獨特的風格，包括特定的生物和專屬材料。</li>\n<li>交通工具：四種火箭等級供星際旅行，以及一輛探測車，用於穿越崎嶇的外星地形。</li>\n<li>科技：標準的加工機器和發電機，以及氧氣產生與分配系統、燃料精煉、抽水、電纜、流體管道和火箭工作台。</li>\n<li>建築：使用超過 250 種建築方塊來裝飾你的建築，從星球專屬的磚塊和石頭，到太空站裝飾和金屬板。</li>\n<li>遊戲內指南手冊，詳細解釋你在 Ad Astra 中進展與繁榮所需的一切！</li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">&nbsp;\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/514923/description_c1dc4fb6-bae9-4212-a47f-d7a3a4dea600.jpg\" alt=\"與朋友同樂的最佳方式。使用 Essential 模組一起遊玩\" width=\"837\" height=\"164\"></a></p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>✨社群連結✨</h2>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Kofi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>",
